"smart_blocks:Computer Science/Core Concepts/TCP.md#FFB86CA6;\">underpins the vast majority of internet applications we use daily, from web Browse (HTTP) and email (SMTP) to file transfer (FTP) and secure shell (SSH). </mark>Without TCP, building applications that require dependable data exchange would be incredibly complex, as every developer would have to implement their own mechanisms for error checking, retransmissions, and ordering. Its importance lies in providing a robust and standardized way to achieve **end-to-end reliable communication**.": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.05506683,-0.06475385,-0.00961267,-0.04246047,-0.04862992,-0.02864048,0.0264315,0.01140117,-0.03748877,-0.01379611,0.04700594,-0.010686,0.03775166,0.01077709,-0.036049,0.07048501,0.01869151,-0.01279828,0.01197896,0.03493706,0.0673602,0.00145754,-0.04295304,-0.01209769,-0.00170718,-0.00538848,-0.03623282,-0.05831121,-0.10093922,-0.16093805,-0.04347878,-0.04354152,-0.08267122,0.01884117,-0.0039612,-0.040532,0.02740491,-0.03319594,-0.07386543,0.0105899,-0.01876829,0.03016479,-0.00311046,-0.00916697,-0.02330586,-0.08415719,-0.00392834,0.02916506,-0.01013028,-0.00582986,0.03555027,0.03908066,0.04833358,0.06091222,0.01565471,0.05821586,0.07090382,0.0364319,0.03536329,0.0118626,0.04723916,0.08353208,-0.17119308,0.06947701,0.11394808,0.04615762,-0.01829421,0.07121045,0.01795406,0.01136303,-0.11531337,-0.00307815,-0.03645935,0.14020562,0.03702919,-0.00677592,0.00303637,-0.0118375,-0.07445344,0.01313167,0.00510157,-0.00160246,0.067118,0.03746523,-0.07814124,0.03042711,-0.00867914,-0.03762046,0.06151859,0.00139367,-0.03230004,0.03856624,0.00002789,0.01918094,-0.01308487,-0.00790345,0.01024281,0.02662416,-0.07040647,0.09139193,0.00335621,0.01366021,-0.04988663,-0.05059182,0.06412055,-0.01814661,-0.01279014,-0.02292624,-0.01435669,0.01050668,-0.03183826,-0.01183301,0.0209472,-0.0431341,0.03128871,0.01598788,-0.00267913,0.00809988,-0.00814815,0.02399542,-0.00892706,0.084298